Dear Aramco Ventures Team,

I am Narges Farahani from Parsa International Group, an Istanbul-based compan=
y that develops AI software for oil, gas and process operations. Given the Di=
gital & Industrial fund's focus, I would like to introduce our work.

Our product lines include:
- Real-time field monitoring and analytics for oil and gas assets;
- Formation-damage detection and prevention during drilling, completion and p=
roduction;
- AI-based artificial-lift optimisation;
- Gas-turbine and process digital twins with predictive maintenance;
- Energy, emissions and carbon management with reinforcement-learning optimis=
ation.

The software is at advanced-prototype stage (TRL 4-5), developed and tested o=
n synthetic and simulated data. Our next step is a field pilot with an operat=
or to validate it on real data, and we are raising seed funding to support th=
at.

We would welcome a short call to understand whether a pilot through Aramco's =
technology programmes, or an investment discussion at a later stage, could be=
 relevant.

Best regards,

Narges Farahani
AI Sector
Parsa International Group
Istanbul, T=C3=BCrkiye
